    "media:imagetext": "Your local Travel Agent\nis our local office\nFULL INFORMATION FROM :\nB.C.P.A. General Sales Agents—\nAUSTRALIA\nTrans-Australia Airlines,\nHead Office — 339 Swanston Street, Melbourne, C.1.\nBooking offices all States\nNEW ZEALAND\nNew Zealand National Airways Corporation,\nwith offices and agencies throughout New Zealand\nFIJI\nNew Zealand National Airways Corporation,\nSuva and Nandi\nHAWAII\nTheo. H. Davies \u0026 Co. Limited,\nDavies Building, Honolulu 2.\nU.S.A.\nB.C.P.A. Booking Office,\n347 Stockton Street, San Francisco. Phone YUkon 6-6971\nBritish Overseas Airways Corporation,\nNew York: 420 Madison Ave., New York 17, N.Y\nAnd in Baltimore, Chicago, Los Angeles,\nWashington.\nCANADA\nTrans Canada Airlines,\nHotel Vancouver, Vancouver, B.C.\nOffices in all major cities\nOR FROM\nSTOPOVER PRIVILEGES -\nThere in adi male prod tears alosed bee\nyour break of journey requirements at the time your\nreservation is made.\nROUND TRIP TICKETS -\nThere are substantial reductions on return fares and\n\"circle\" trips (where you return by air by a different\nroute).\nAIR CARGO -\nInvestigate B.C.P.A.'s efficient air cargo service.\nFull details gladly supplied by all forwarding agents,\nB.C.P.A. offices or General Sales Agents.\nCHILDREN'S FARES —\nChildren under the age of 12 years travel at 50%\nof the adult fare. There are, too, further special\nreductions for infants under two years of age. Your\nTravel Agent will gladly supply full details.\nPrinted in Australia\n2014.095\n6-42",
